```

```json
{"type": "say", "text": "Understood, Nadia. I'll reach out to the music licensor immediately to explore whether the license can be amended or upgraded to cover worldwide streaming rights. I'll also get the territorial limits entered into the release tracker right away. I should have an answer on whether an upgrade is possible — and at what cost — before we reconvene."}
```

